			"notes": "This new updated adds parity between all the different types of stone. Each stone variant has its own variant of bricks, mossy bricks, chiseled block, polished block, tiles, pillar, chiseled pillar, and more. In total, this update adds 876 new blocks.\nNote: Many of the crafting recipes are not yet implemented. This was a total headache to do and I kinda gave up on the crafting recipes. Crafting recipes for terracotta variants, cobbled variants, and new smooth stone blocks all need to be added still."
